Job Description
We are seeking an experienced Oracle FLEXCUBE Global PAYplus (FGPP) Production Support SME to troubleshoot complex production issues, perform root cause analysis, implement configuration-based solutions, and manage technical escalations.
Key Responsibilities
•	Investigate production issues through triage, issue recreation, trace analysis, database queries, and GUI analysis.
