•	Manage L2 escalations and coordinate with L3 teams for code fixes.
•	Support QA/L2 teams in testing fixes and configuration changes.
•	Lead customer-facing technical discussions and collaborate with L1, L2, L3, and product management teams.
Required Skills
•	Strong hands-on Oracle FLEXCUBE Global PAYplus (FGPP) experience.
•	Recent FGPP experience within the last 3 years is mandatory; Classic GPP experience alone is not sufficient.
•	Expertise in production support, trace analysis, troubleshooting, and root cause analysis.
•	Hands-on experience with FGPP profiles, rules, and complex configurations.
•	Strong payment processing knowledge and database troubleshooting skills.
•	Excellent customer communication and technical escalation management skills.

